1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,588
春天，把池塘轻轻唤醒了。
Spring gently woke the pond.

2
00:00:09,588 --> 00:00:13,848
一群小蝌蚪，第一次看见了这个世界。
A little shoal of tadpoles saw the world for the first time.

3
00:00:16,148 --> 00:00:22,088
鸭妈妈带着宝宝游过。可是，我们的妈妈在哪里？
A mother duck swam by with her ducklings. But where was our mother?

4
00:00:23,088 --> 00:00:26,364
鸭妈妈，您是我们的妈妈吗？
Mother Duck, are you our mother?

5
00:00:27,364 --> 00:00:32,800
你们的妈妈有两只大眼睛。往前找找吧！
Your mother has two big eyes. Keep looking ahead!

6
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,936
大眼睛！小蝌蚪追上了金色的鲤鱼。
Big eyes! The tadpoles hurried after a golden carp.

7
00:00:40,936 --> 00:00:45,652
我不是你们的妈妈。她还有四条腿呢。
I am not your mother. She has four legs, too.

8
00:00:47,952 --> 00:00:52,404
四条腿！那一定是岸边的乌龟吧？
Four legs! Could it be the turtle by the bank?

9
00:00:53,404 --> 00:00:58,768
别着急。你们的妈妈，穿着绿色的衣裳。
Take your time. Your mother wears a green coat.

10
00:01:01,068 --> 00:01:06,312
天忽然暗了。雨，把池塘敲得叮叮咚咚。
The sky grew dark. Rain tapped a little song on the pond.

11
00:01:07,312 --> 00:01:11,452
世界这么大，妈妈会不会找不到我们？
The world is so big. What if Mom cannot find us?

12
00:01:12,452 --> 00:01:16,880
他们挨在一起。谁也没有放开谁。
They stayed close together. No one left anyone behind.

13
00:01:19,180 --> 00:01:23,920
就在这时，荷叶下面，传来一声：呱！
Then, from beneath a lotus leaf, came a gentle croak!

14
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:29,972
大眼睛，四条腿，绿色的衣裳！妈妈！
Big eyes, four legs, a green coat! Mom!

15
00:01:30,972 --> 00:01:34,176
好孩子，妈妈在这里。
My little ones, Mommy is right here.

16
00:01:36,476 --> 00:01:41,840
他们终于明白：一路寻找，也是在一点一点长大。
They discovered that every step of the search helped them grow.

17
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:47,532
而妈妈的怀抱，是世界上最温暖的池塘。
And their mother’s embrace was the warmest pond in the world.